        "end": "00:13:26.560"
      },
      {
        "text": "lowkey allergic to cats. So, um, yes, I",
        "startMs": 802480,
        "endMs": 809040,
        "start": "00:13:22.480",
        "end": "00:13:29.040"
      },
      {
        "text": "will pick the dog 10 times over the cat.",
        "startMs": 806560,
        "endMs": 811680,
        "start": "00:13:26.560",
        "end": "00:13:31.680"
      },
      {
        "text": "Sorry.",
        "startMs": 809040,
        "endMs": 814959,
        "start": "00:13:29.040",
        "end": "00:13:34.959"
      },
      {
        "text": "Okay. If you could use only one trigger",
