        "endMs": 819120,
        "start": "00:13:31.680",
        "end": "00:13:39.120"
      },
      {
        "text": "forever, what would it be? One trigger",
        "startMs": 814959,
        "endMs": 822959,
        "start": "00:13:34.959",
        "end": "00:13:42.959"
      },
      {
        "text": "forever. Um,",
        "startMs": 819120,
        "endMs": 827240,
        "start": "00:13:39.120",
        "end": "00:13:47.240"
      },
      {
        "text": "I think I would do",
        "startMs": 822959,
        "endMs": 827240,
        "start": "00:13:42.959",
        "end": "00:13:47.240"
      },
      {
        "text": "if I could only if I could only use one",
