        "endMs": 851199,
        "start": "00:14:06.320",
        "end": "00:14:11.199"
      },
      {
        "text": "think it's really soothing. I like to",
        "startMs": 849600,
        "endMs": 854079,
        "start": "00:14:09.600",
        "end": "00:14:14.079"
      },
      {
        "text": "listen to it. It's It's very tinkly. So,",
