        "endMs": 856160,
        "start": "00:14:11.199",
        "end": "00:14:16.160"
      },
      {
        "text": "if I had to do it for the rest of my",
        "startMs": 854079,
        "endMs": 862399,
        "start": "00:14:14.079",
        "end": "00:14:22.399"
      },
      {
        "text": "life, I would use that one. Okay.",
        "startMs": 856160,
        "endMs": 864800,
        "start": "00:14:16.160",
        "end": "00:14:24.800"
      },
      {
        "text": "What's something most people don't know",
        "startMs": 862399,
        "endMs": 866880,
        "start": "00:14:22.399",
        "end": "00:14:26.880"
      },
      {
        "text": "about you?",
        "startMs": 864800,
        "endMs": 869880,
        "start": "00:14:24.800",
        "end": "00:14:29.880"
      },
      {
        "text": "Um,",
        "startMs": 866880,
        "endMs": 869880,
        "start": "00:14:26.880",
        "end": "00:14:29.880"
      },
      {
        "text": "uh, that I used to do taekwondo. I guess",
        "startMs": 871199,
        "endMs": 878320,
        "start": "00:14:31.199",
        "end": "00:14:38.320"
      },
      {
        "text": "that was my sport that I grew up doing.",
