        "endMs": 881839,
        "start": "00:14:35.040",
        "end": "00:14:41.839"
      },
      {
        "text": "But I don't do it anymore. So yeah, I",
        "startMs": 878320,
        "endMs": 885240,
        "start": "00:14:38.320",
        "end": "00:14:45.240"
      },
      {
        "text": "did that wonder.",
        "startMs": 881839,
        "endMs": 885240,
        "start": "00:14:41.839",
        "end": "00:14:45.240"
      },
      {
        "text": "Oh my goodness.",
        "startMs": 886959,
        "endMs": 891920,
        "start": "00:14:46.959",
        "end": "00:14:51.920"
      },
      {
        "text": "What the hell is this? This is so many",
        "startMs": 889279,
        "endMs": 893600,
        "start": "00:14:49.279",
        "end": "00:14:53.600"
      },
      {
        "text": "questions.",
        "startMs": 891920,
        "endMs": 896600,
        "start": "00:14:51.920",
        "end": "00:14:56.600"
      },
      {
        "text": "Okay.",
        "startMs": 893600,
        "endMs": 896600,
        "start": "00:14:53.600",
        "end": "00:14:56.600"
      },
      {
        "text": "Well,",
        "startMs": 899760,
        "endMs": 905120,
        "start": "00:14:59.760",
        "end": "00:15:05.120"
      },
      {
        "text": "what's the biggest green flag someone",
