        "start": "00:15:02.480",
        "end": "00:15:07.519"
      },
      {
        "text": "can have?",
        "startMs": 905120,
        "endMs": 912199,
        "start": "00:15:05.120",
        "end": "00:15:12.199"
      },
      {
        "text": "Um, I think if",
        "startMs": 907519,
        "endMs": 912199,
        "start": "00:15:07.519",
        "end": "00:15:12.199"
      },
      {
        "text": "honestly if the person is kind, if the",
