        "endMs": 936760,
        "start": "00:15:28.320",
        "end": "00:15:36.760"
      },
      {
        "text": "people. That's green flag. Green flag.",
        "startMs": 931279,
        "endMs": 936760,
        "start": "00:15:31.279",
        "end": "00:15:36.760"
      },
      {
        "text": "Um,",
        "startMs": 937120,
        "endMs": 940120,
        "start": "00:15:37.120",
        "end": "00:15:40.120"
      },
      {
        "text": "would you rather be extremely rich with",
        "startMs": 941920,
        "endMs": 946560,
        "start": "00:15:41.920",
        "end": "00:15:46.560"
      },
      {
        "text": "no friends or dead broke with amazing",
        "startMs": 944320,
        "endMs": 949560,
        "start": "00:15:44.320",
        "end": "00:15:49.560"
      },
      {
        "text": "friends?",
        "startMs": 946560,
        "endMs": 949560,
        "start": "00:15:46.560",
        "end": "00:15:49.560"
      },
      {
        "text": "That is such a hard question.",
        "startMs": 951600,
        "endMs": 955720,
        "start": "00:15:51.600",
        "end": "00:15:55.720"
      },
      {
        "text": "I'm thinking",
