        "endMs": 965759,
        "start": "00:16:01.440",
        "end": "00:16:05.759"
      },
      {
        "text": "am I going to do with all the money? You",
        "startMs": 964399,
        "endMs": 968560,
        "start": "00:16:04.399",
        "end": "00:16:08.560"
      },
      {
        "text": "know, I love I love spending my money on",
