        "endMs": 971839,
        "start": "00:16:05.759",
        "end": "00:16:11.839"
      },
      {
        "text": "my friends. So, I'd rather be dead broke",
        "startMs": 968560,
        "endMs": 974320,
        "start": "00:16:08.560",
        "end": "00:16:14.320"
      },
      {
        "text": "with zero money but amazing great",
