        "endMs": 1035439,
        "start": "00:17:08.720",
        "end": "00:17:15.439"
      },
      {
        "text": "rude of me to keep complaining about it.",
        "startMs": 1032400,
        "endMs": 1038079,
        "start": "00:17:12.400",
        "end": "00:17:18.079"
      },
      {
        "text": "Um, I if I don't like it, I should do",
