        "endMs": 1043839,
        "start": "00:17:20.000",
        "end": "00:17:23.839"
      },
      {
        "text": "have because",
        "startMs": 1041919,
        "endMs": 1047919,
        "start": "00:17:21.919",
        "end": "00:17:27.919"
      },
      {
        "text": "life is very precious and",
        "startMs": 1043839,
        "endMs": 1050160,
        "start": "00:17:23.839",
        "end": "00:17:30.160"
      },
      {
        "text": "it's not good sitting around here moping",
        "startMs": 1047919,
        "endMs": 1054160,
        "start": "00:17:27.919",
        "end": "00:17:34.160"
      },
      {
        "text": "around and being sad about it. So",
        "startMs": 1050160,
        "endMs": 1056640,
        "start": "00:17:30.160",
        "end": "00:17:36.640"
      },
      {
        "text": "I think I should be more kinder to",
        "startMs": 1054160,
        "endMs": 1060240,
        "start": "00:17:34.160",
        "end": "00:17:40.240"
      },
      {
        "text": "myself because mental health",
        "startMs": 1056640,
        "endMs": 1062160,
        "start": "00:17:36.640",
        "end": "00:17:42.160"
      },
      {
        "text": "it actually affects your physical health",
        "startMs": 1060240,
        "endMs": 1065280,
        "start": "00:17:40.240",
        "end": "00:17:45.280"
      },
      {
        "text": "more than you think it does.",
        "startMs": 1062160,
        "endMs": 1068480,
        "start": "00:17:42.160",
        "end": "00:17:48.480"
      },
      {
        "text": "Okay. Um,",
        "startMs": 1065280,
        "endMs": 1069919,
        "start": "00:17:45.280",
        "end": "00:17:49.919"
      },
      {
        "text": "someone went, \"Why didn't you go to",
