        "endMs": 1071600,
        "start": "00:17:48.480",
        "end": "00:17:51.600"
      },
      {
        "text": "stream at university?\" Guys, I don't",
        "startMs": 1069919,
        "endMs": 1073679,
        "start": "00:17:49.919",
        "end": "00:17:53.679"
      },
      {
        "text": "stream.",
        "startMs": 1071600,
        "endMs": 1076679,
        "start": "00:17:51.600",
        "end": "00:17:56.679"
      },
      {
        "text": "Period.",
        "startMs": 1073679,
        "endMs": 1076679,
        "start": "00:17:53.679",
        "end": "00:17:56.679"
      },
      {
        "text": "If you could be any higher, what would",
        "startMs": 1076960,
        "endMs": 1082919,
        "start": "00:17:56.960",
        "end": "00:18:02.919"
      },
      {
        "text": "it be? Um,",
        "startMs": 1078559,
        "endMs": 1082919,
        "start": "00:17:58.559",
        "end": "00:18:02.919"
      },
      {
        "text": "what height? Honestly, maybe like super",
