        "endMs": 1091840,
        "start": "00:18:03.440",
        "end": "00:18:11.840"
      },
      {
        "text": "super tall. Like maybe a little high",
        "startMs": 1089520,
        "endMs": 1093679,
        "start": "00:18:09.520",
        "end": "00:18:13.679"
      },
      {
        "text": "like taller than I am right now. Maybe",
        "startMs": 1091840,
        "endMs": 1096880,
        "start": "00:18:11.840",
        "end": "00:18:16.880"
      },
      {
        "text": "like I think my dream would be like",
        "startMs": 1093679,
        "endMs": 1101600,
        "start": "00:18:13.679",
        "end": "00:18:21.600"
      },
      {
        "text": "180 cm as like at a max like 5 cm taller",
