        "endMs": 1103919,
        "start": "00:18:16.880",
        "end": "00:18:23.919"
      },
      {
        "text": "than what I'm already at.",
        "startMs": 1101600,
        "endMs": 1106799,
        "start": "00:18:21.600",
        "end": "00:18:26.799"
      },
      {
        "text": "That would be good. Have you ever been",
        "startMs": 1103919,
        "endMs": 1109120,
        "start": "00:18:23.919",
        "end": "00:18:29.120"
      },
      {
        "text": "to New Zealand?",
        "startMs": 1106799,
        "endMs": 1112640,
        "start": "00:18:26.799",
        "end": "00:18:32.640"
      },
      {
        "text": "No, but I do want to visit visit it one",
        "startMs": 1109120,
        "endMs": 1115919,
        "start": "00:18:29.120",
        "end": "00:18:35.919"
      },
      {
        "text": "day because it's like a brother country.",
        "startMs": 1112640,
        "endMs": 1118240,
        "start": "00:18:32.640",
        "end": "00:18:38.240"
      },
      {
        "text": "So",
        "startMs": 1115919,
        "endMs": 1122400,
        "start": "00:18:35.919",
        "end": "00:18:42.400"
      },
      {
        "text": "it would be nice to visit. Okay.",
        "startMs": 1118240,
        "endMs": 1125880,
        "start": "00:18:38.240",
        "end": "00:18:45.880"
      },
      {
        "text": "Uh GB,",
        "startMs": 1122400,
        "endMs": 1125880,
        "start": "00:18:42.400",
        "end": "00:18:45.880"
      },
      {
        "text": "she asks, \"What's your death row meal?",
