        "endMs": 1389440,
        "start": "00:23:02.400",
        "end": "00:23:09.440"
      },
      {
        "text": "Um, oh, hold on.",
        "startMs": 1386240,
        "endMs": 1392400,
        "start": "00:23:06.240",
        "end": "00:23:12.400"
      },
      {
        "text": "Okay, guys, I'm actually back. Fun fact,",
        "startMs": 1389440,
        "endMs": 1394159,
        "start": "00:23:09.440",
        "end": "00:23:14.159"
      },
      {
        "text": "I've gone for a couple hours and I've",
        "startMs": 1392400,
        "endMs": 1395840,
        "start": "00:23:12.400",
        "end": "00:23:15.840"
      },
      {
        "text": "come back because I actually went to the",
        "startMs": 1394159,
        "endMs": 1400159,
        "start": "00:23:14.159",
        "end": "00:23:20.159"
      },
      {
        "text": "gym. So, we're back from the gym. Okay,",
        "startMs": 1395840,
        "endMs": 1404559,
        "start": "00:23:15.840",
        "end": "00:23:24.559"
      },
      {
        "text": "but moving on. The next question is,",
