        "endMs": 1438400,
        "start": "00:23:54.640",
        "end": "00:23:58.400"
      },
      {
        "text": "sweet.",
        "startMs": 1437039,
        "endMs": 1441919,
        "start": "00:23:57.039",
        "end": "00:24:01.919"
      },
      {
        "text": "and they're very sweet. Although",
        "startMs": 1438400,
        "endMs": 1443840,
        "start": "00:23:58.400",
        "end": "00:24:03.840"
      },
      {
        "text": "I haven't been to Vietnam in a very long",
